---
import DetailHeader from "../../components/DetailHeader.astro";
import DetailPostLayout from "../../layouts/DetailPostLayout.astro";
import CallToAction from "../../components/CallToAction.astro";
---
<DetailPostLayout
	title="Warung Jus - Neobrutalist POS System | Febiadi Wisnu Akbar"
	description="A Neobrutalist Point of Sale (POS) and real-time sales reporting system designed for local juice vendors with QRIS payment integration."
	keywords="Warung Jus, POS, Neobrutalism, QRIS, Next.js, Febiadi Wisnu Akbar"
>
	<div class="post">
		<main class="post-wrapper">
			<DetailHeader
				tag="POINT OF SALE"
				description="Neobrutalist POS & Real-Time Sales Reporting System">
				<h1 class="font-type">
					Warung Jus
				</h1>
			</DetailHeader>

			<section>
				<div class="content">
					<div class="row desc">
						<div class="col-1a">
							<h3 class="post-title">Project Goal</h3>
							<p class="post-desc">
								Warung Jus was developed to digitalize cash registry operations for micro-merchants and street food vendors. The primary objective was to replace slow manual ledger logs with an interactive, responsive Neobrutalist-styled POS dashboard that allows vendors to process orders, manage menu lists, customize QRIS receipts, and monitor daily revenue trends instantly on mobile or tablet devices.
							</p>

							<h3 class="post-title" style="margin-top:2rem;">Engineering Challenges</h3>
							<p class="post-desc">
								The critical challenge lay in ensuring complete offline resilience for order logging while maintaining high UI responsiveness. Additionally, generating instant local dynamic QRIS codes in compliance with Indonesian payment regulations required robust client-side canvas render loops and string formatting controls.
							</p>

							<h3 class="post-title" style="margin-top:2rem;">Key Technical Achievements</h3>
							<ul class="achievement-list">
								<li>Built a high-performance offline-first local cache synchronization bridge for seamless POS data storage during network drops.</li>
								<li>Crafted a fully responsive Neobrutalist dashboard using Tailwind CSS, optimized for mobile cashier layouts.</li>
								<li>Developed a dynamic menu analytics logger visualizing high-volume sales trends and variant distributions.</li>
								<li>Integrated automated QRIS generator layouts mapping static vendor payloads with dynamic price overlays.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div class="col-1a" style="margin-top:2rem;">
							<div class="btn">
								<CallToAction href="https://warung-jus.vercel.app" target="_blank">
									Launch Production Version
								</CallToAction>
								<CallToAction href="https://github.com/rheatkhs" target="_blank">
									GitHub Repository
								</CallToAction>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
	</div>
</DetailPostLayout>

<style>
.achievement-list {
	list-style: disc;
	padding-left: 1.5rem;
	margin: 1rem 0;
	color: var(--color-200);
	line-height: 1.8;
}
.achievement-list li {
	margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
</style>
